<title>SWEDEN: Swedish producer prices rise 0.7 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Swedish producer prices rise 0.7 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish producer prices rose 0.7 percent in April from March or 0.2 percent in the previous 12 months, Statistics Sweden said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>(Percentage change)	 April 97    March 97    April 96</p>
<p>Export prices		 1.3	     0.4	  -0.8</p>
<p>Import prices		 0.9	     0.0	  -1.1</p>
<p>Producer prices	     0.7	     0.4	  -0.5</p>
<p>Year/year		     0.2	    -1.0	  -1.7</p>
<p>Note - The market had expected PPI to rise by 0.3 percent, according to a Reuter survey.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
